<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Colossus Form</ansi> mutation

You are a giant now, mountainous and unstoppable, each blow landing
with the weight of a falling wall.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Dense Muscles and the fullest Titan Growth

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Tremendous strength, vastly deepened reserves of health, you cannot
  be knocked down or grappled, and your looming bulk draws enemies to
  attack you first
  Every hand you have can wield a two-handed weapon alone

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  A target this size is easy to hit: you lose much of your ability to
  dodge
  Your growing body holds part of your conviction in reserve, leaving
  less for companions

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
